      porQueImporta: 'This is one of the few Uruguayan energy-sector cases that ended in a criminal conviction over the use of public money, and it sets a concrete standard: a state company\'s corporate card belongs to the company, not to whoever chairs it, and misusing it can amount to embezzlement.',
